<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Transmission Control Computer Assembly Terminals</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The transmission control computer is mounted on the transaxle and uses waterproof connectors, so voltage inspection of each terminal and oscilloscope waveform checks cannot be performed with it installed on the vehicle.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Check the actuator operation and communication establishment using the data monitor and Active Test with the SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000AW301NX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
