<step1>
<ptxt>Inspect Transmission Control Computer Assembly Wire Harness Side Connector</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the transmission control computer connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C169062J08" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage and resistance between each terminal of the actuator assembly wire harness side connector and body ground.</ptxt>
